WEBVTT

00:12:59.184 --> 00:13:02.682
Candidates with foreign accents
are less likely to get called back too,

00:13:02.706 --> 00:13:04.800
even if they say the exact same words,

00:13:04.824 --> 00:13:06.580
they're judged as less savvy.

00:13:07.127 --> 00:13:09.125
And if you're a bald guy like me,

00:13:09.149 --> 00:13:11.400
you're seen as having
more leadership potential

00:13:11.424 --> 00:13:13.018
if you shave your head.

00:13:13.338 --> 00:13:15.371
That's obviously why I shave my head.

00:13:16.404 --> 00:13:17.575
In one of her studies,

00:13:17.599 --> 00:13:19.558
Lauren discovered some surprising biases

00:13:19.582 --> 00:13:21.170
in the hiring process at banks,

00:13:21.194 --> 00:13:23.298
law firms and consulting firms.

00:13:23.322 --> 00:13:25.067
LR: I did 120 interviews with people

00:13:25.091 --> 00:13:27.257
who were charged
with interviewing candidates,

00:13:27.281 --> 00:13:28.464
making decisions.

00:13:28.488 --> 00:13:31.345
I spent nine months
as a participant observer in a firm,